<div class="annotated">
<div class="examples u-stack u-gap-12">

<figure class="example">
<div class="example-frame example-tagged">
<span class="example-tag">App</span>
<div class="u-stack u-gap-4">
<div class="u-row colour-example-head">
<h3 class="u-text-heading">Open jobs</h3>
<a href="#in-use" class="u-text-small" data-label="link">View all</a>
</div>
<div class="u-card colour-example-list" data-label="border · around the card" data-label-corner="below">
<div class="colour-example-item"><span class="u-text-data">#1042</span><span>Ana Reyes</span><span class="u-badge u-badge-danger">Overdue</span><span class="u-text-muted" data-label="muted">2 days late</span></div>
<div class="colour-example-item" data-label="divider · between rows" data-label-corner><span class="u-text-data">#1039</span><span>Sam Okafor</span><span class="u-badge u-badge-info">In progress</span><span class="u-text-muted">Due Friday</span></div>
<div class="colour-example-item"><span class="u-text-data">#1036</span><span>Lee Martin</span><span class="u-badge u-badge-warning">Waiting on customer</span><span class="u-text-muted">Quote sent</span></div>
<div class="colour-example-item colour-example-changed" data-label="highlight · just changed" data-label-corner><span class="u-text-data">#1031</span><span>Mia Chen</span><span class="u-badge u-badge-success">Ready for pickup</span><span class="u-text-muted">Just now</span></div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<figcaption class="example-caption"><span>App list. Status is a small square in its signal colour next to ink text, so the words carry the meaning. The row you just changed gets the yellow wash, and the only coloured text is the link.</span></figcaption>
</figure>

<figure class="example">
<div class="example-frame example-tagged">
<span class="example-tag">App</span>
<div class="u-stack u-gap-6 colour-example-form">
<div class="u-field">
<label for="colour-phone">Customer phone</label>
<input id="colour-phone" class="u-input" value="555-01" data-label="border-input" placeholder=" ">
<p class="u-error" data-label="danger · square and text">Add the area code, like (416) 555-0199.</p>
</div>
<div class="u-row">
<span class="u-btn u-btn-primary">Save job</span>
<span data-label="danger · fill, white text"><span class="u-btn u-btn-danger">Delete job</span></span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<figcaption class="example-caption"><span>App form. The input edge uses the input border grey. The error is red text after a red square. The destructive button is a red fill with white text.</span></figcaption>
</figure>

